stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DraftProfile
    DraftProfile --> ValidatedProfile: schema + privacy + tokenizer checks
    ValidatedProfile --> SyntheticBootstrap: no measured trace yet
    ValidatedProfile --> TraceReplay: representative trace available
    SyntheticBootstrap --> EndpointBenchmark: smoke test passed
    TraceReplay --> EndpointBenchmark: replay adapter ready
    EndpointBenchmark --> EvidenceReview: observations normalized
    EvidenceReview --> Rejected: missing telemetry / invalid quality / cache contamination
    EvidenceReview --> ProvisionalEnvelope: sufficient non-production evidence
    EvidenceReview --> ProductionEnvelope: representative production or approved pre-prod evidence
    ProvisionalEnvelope --> Rebenchmark: model, tokenizer, graph, prompt or traffic changes
    ProductionEnvelope --> Rebenchmark: drift, SLO breach or scale change
    Rejected --> DraftProfile
    Rebenchmark --> DraftProfile
    ProvisionalEnvelope --> [*]
    ProductionEnvelope --> [*]
